{"id":"n62455-1-14","stage":1,"title":"등 · 背","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62455-1-14-1","ko":"하루 종일 서 있었더니 허리가 아프네.","zh":"我一整天都在站着，腰好痛啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"하루","meaning":"一天","explanation":"하루：一天。","readings":[{"term":"하루","audio":"/audio/621a158068fae5de1aee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49315","senseId":"2","lemma":"하루","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하루","audio":"/audio/621a158068fae5de1aee.mp3"}},{"text":"종일","meaning":"整天，一天到晚","explanation":"종일：整天，一天到晚。","readings":[{"term":"종일","audio":"/audio/02f69fc1875bf3107006.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91758","senseId":"1","lemma":"종일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"종일","audio":"/audio/02f69fc1875bf3107006.mp3"}},{"text":"서","meaning":"站，站立","explanation":"서다：站，站立；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"서다","audio":"/audio/4fccaaf883d3c239af91.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68756","senseId":"1","lemma":"서다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"서","audio":"/audio/a5bc3484406e4a8fc29e.mp3"}},{"text":"있었더니","meaning":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","explanation":"있다：某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；더니：根据先前观察的情况，引出后来的变化、结果或对比。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"3","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있었더니","audio":"/audio/986aebfd45397c77d469.mp3"}},{"text":"허리가","meaning":"腰","explanation":"허리：腰；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"허리","audio":"/audio/777cb8e22269860361d6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30201","senseId":"1","lemma":"허리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"허리가","audio":"/audio/ce5c6c7b6a73dfaf9320.mp3"}},{"text":"아프네.","meaning":"疼，痛","explanation":"아프다：疼，痛；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"아프다","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62239","senseId":"2","lemma":"아프다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아프네","audio":"/audio/782e49983adbb5365b5b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"621a158068fae5de","term":"하루","zh":"一天","audio":"/audio/621a158068fae5de1aee.mp3","entryId":"49315","definition":"人们从早晨到日落所活动的时间。","pronunciation":["하루"]},{"id":"02f69fc1875bf310","term":"종일","zh":"整天，一天到晚","audio":"/audio/02f69fc1875bf3107006.mp3","entryId":"91758","definition":"从早晨到夜晚的时间段。","pronunciation":["종일"]},{"id":"4fccaaf883d3c239","term":"서다","zh":"站，站立","audio":"/audio/4fccaaf883d3c239af91.mp3","entryId":"68756","definition":"人或动物把脚放在地上，使身体挺直。","pronunciation":["서다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"777cb8e222698603","term":"허리","zh":"腰","audio":"/audio/777cb8e22269860361d6.mp3","entryId":"30201","definition":"人或动物身体上从肋骨下方到尾骨的部分。","pronunciation":["허리"]},{"id":"912c6f176a189a34","term":"아프다","zh":"疼，痛","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3","entryId":"62239","definition":"身体的某些部位使用过多而感到疲劳或难受。","pronunciation":["아프다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f0db4b4c952505d2f795.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62455-1-14-2","ko":"여기에 등을 좀 기대고 쉬어.","zh":"你靠在这里休息一会儿吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여기에","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여기에","audio":"/audio/89d8715c5ec0d5fb9df5.mp3"}},{"text":"등을","meaning":"背，脊背，背部","explanation":"등：背，脊背，背部；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"등","audio":"/audio/ad8c9dea07d94cabd325.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62455","senseId":"1","lemma":"등","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"등을","audio":"/audio/b9eb89cb2f2242dbae05.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一会儿","explanation":"좀：一会儿。","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"2","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"기대고","meaning":"靠，倚靠","explanation":"기대다：靠，倚靠；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"기대다","audio":"/audio/94de7ced1ffbf01e16ac.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32494","senseId":"1","lemma":"기대다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"기대고","audio":"/audio/3789d01a1d475c94a3a6.mp3"}},{"text":"쉬어.","meaning":"休息，歇","explanation":"쉬다：休息，歇；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"쉬다","audio":"/audio/62b3b824836a1f2cb1c5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71280","senseId":"1","lemma":"쉬다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"쉬어","audio":"/audio/3beb3477b396a621ab24.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"ad8c9dea07d94cab","term":"등","zh":"背，脊背，背部","audio":"/audio/ad8c9dea07d94cabd325.mp3","entryId":"62455","definition":"人或动物的身体中胸部和腹部反面的部分。","pronunciation":["등"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一会儿","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"时间短暂地。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"94de7ced1ffbf01e","term":"기대다","zh":"靠，倚靠","audio":"/audio/94de7ced1ffbf01e16ac.mp3","entryId":"32494","definition":"把身体或东西歪斜地倚在某物上。","pronunciation":["기ː대다"]},{"id":"62b3b824836a1f2c","term":"쉬다","zh":"休息，歇","audio":"/audio/62b3b824836a1f2cb1c5.mp3","entryId":"71280","definition":"为去除疲劳而使身体舒适。","pronunciation":["쉬ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/816d521cb90a26ff204a.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.535,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62455","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":43,"sequenceScore":1.9138,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我一整天都在站着，腰好痛啊。","你靠在这里休息一会儿吧。","您父亲是做什么工作的呢？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我一整天都在站着，腰好痛啊。","你靠在这里休息一会儿吧。","您父亲是做什么工作的呢？"],"answer":1}]}
